fixture zone1_03_route_fewest_bounces
doc Room 03 (BUILD.md s5 tech 3): the fewest bounces that cross: six, at 2.3 a second, not 4. An air dash 9 frames and an air jump on the dash's last frame (an air dash-jump) 17 frames after each bounce and a down-strike on the fall, a stride of 26 frames and 520 u at 20 u/f kept. Five of these fall into the spikes (zone1_03_control_five_slow). The links are what the rhythm costs: the room asks ten bounces only of a chain no slower than 4 a second.
